{"lines": ["¿Sigues respirando? Pues lo estás haciendo de la verga, hijo de la chingada.", "Cómo respirar. Sí, pendejo, respirar. Alguien tenía que decirlo, porque eres un puto inútil.", "Primero, abra la nariz. Ese par de hoyos donde se mete el dedo, cochino de mierda.", "Ahora jale aire. Despacio. No se chingue toda la habitación, pedazo de animal hijo de puta.", "Sostenga. Uno... dos... pinche tres, cabrón.", "Ahora suelte el aire. Con cuidado... Ah, valió verga, puta madre.", "Felicidades. Ya respira. Ahora váyase a la chingada, hijo de su puta madre, que yo ya cobré."], "words": [["¿Sigues", 0.0, 0.255], ["respirando?", 0.29, 0.998], ["Pues", 1.2779999999999998, 1.4639999999999997], ["lo", 1.4989999999999999, 1.545], ["estás", 1.5679999999999998, 1.7189999999999999], ["haciendo", 1.742, 1.9749999999999996], ["de", 1.9979999999999998, 2.044], ["la", 2.0669999999999997, 2.114], ["verga,", 2.149, 2.404], ["hijo", 2.427, 2.625], ["de", 2.6599999999999997, 2.706], ["la", 2.7289999999999996, 2.776], ["chingada.", 2.81, 3.5069999999999997], ["Cómo", 3.7869999999999995, 4.054], ["respirar.", 4.123999999999999, 4.821], ["Sí,", 5.100999999999999, 5.425999999999998], ["pendejo,", 5.4609999999999985, 6.029999999999998], ["respirar.", 6.064999999999998, 6.807999999999998], ["Alguien", 7.087999999999999, 7.377999999999998], ["tenía", 7.424999999999999, 7.656999999999998], ["que", 7.691999999999998, 7.760999999999999], ["decirlo,", 7.795999999999999, 8.261], ["porque", 8.283999999999999, 8.515999999999998], ["eres", 8.539, 8.666999999999998], ["un", 8.725, 8.770999999999999], ["puto", 8.853, 9.084999999999999], ["inútil.", 9.107999999999999, 9.665], ["Primero,", 9.945, 10.653], ["abra", 10.862, 11.059000000000001], ["la", 11.094000000000001, 11.141], ["nariz.", 11.175, 11.733], ["Ese", 12.013000000000002, 12.234000000000002], ["par", 12.292000000000002, 12.396], ["de", 12.454, 12.501000000000001], ["hoyos", 12.547, 12.791], ["donde", 12.814000000000002, 12.954], ["se", 12.977